@DocumentConversion.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5104
@jobId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health
GET {{DocumentConversion.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### List jobs
GET {{DocumentConversion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Job detail (replace @jobId after submit)
GET {{DocumentConversion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}
Accept: application/json

###
# Multipart POST is easiest via Swagger (/swagger) or README curl:
# curl.exe -X POST "http://localhost:5104/api/jobs" -F "file=@samples/text-based.pdf" -F "outputFormat=Docx"
